      "pageNumbering": "User: PDF 1–24, printed Arabic page +4. Engineer: PDF 25–80, printed Arabic page +28.",
      "scope": "Original manufacturer booklet in a third-party archive. Accenta G4 with 8EP417A LCD keypad; the LED/Optima compact variations are distinguished. Revision footers are on PDF24 and PDF80.",
      "archiveRecordId": "ade-cabf3c545321"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "IU1-0040 Rev1.0 User Guide + IE1-0040 Rev1.1 Engineer Manual, combined original manufacturer booklet. Accenta G4 LCD baseline; no G3 or built-in Optima compact LED menu substitution.",
    "No hardware timing, PA gesture, live output or communicator is reproduced.",
    "The full emulator includes all documented engineer menus; guided lessons are selected practice routes.",
    "The precise omission ▲ behaviour remains explicitly unverified. Repeating a zone digit is not taught as reinstatement; unsetting restores omissions.",
    "All fixture code values start empty. The app never asks for real credentials."
  ],
